{"repositoryId":1405853881,"availability":"available","full":"gerardorosch02/thermo-fr","name":"thermo-fr","description":"Live day-ahead forecast of French power prices. Models how temperature drives French demand (R² 0.96), then forecasts hourly prices using only data available before the 12:00 auction gate. Runs automatically every weekday and is scored against actual prices. Beats the previous-day benchmark by about 20% out of sample.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T13:55:57Z","updated":"2026-10-18T16:32:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://thermo-fr-cy6smxhzz5tj77jmvyqfng.streamlit.app/","topics":["electricity-markets","energy-trade","france","lightgbm","power-price-forecasting","power-prices","python","streamlit","time-series","time-series-forecasting"],"demo":"https://thermo-fr-cy6smxhzz5tj77jmvyqfng.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:47.582Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:47.582Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:47.582Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:47.582Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An hourly forecast of the French day-ahead power price, issued before the 12:00 Paris auction gate, with a recalibrated probability of negative prices and a model of the day's shape valued with a battery. Each forecast is scored against the auction result and against the EEX French day-ahead future traded 11:15 to 12:00 Paris.","Live app: thermo-fr-cy6smxhzz5tj77jmvyqfng.streamlit.app, updated each weekday morning before the market window and each afternoon after the auction."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gerardorosch02/thermo-fr/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"980cb0cde0d91c8b6333941c43b762f4498c715ac12a6cb72363fbeab99cf237","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:47.703Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:47.703Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItD